Name: Helium
Short Name: helium
URL: https://github.com/imputnet/helium
Version: 0.14.7
Revision: 8030a8a3050151a141c06cc5a85f95cbbdc42a25
License: GPL-3.0-only
License File: LICENSE
Shipped: yes
Security Critical: no

Description:
cmux adapts Helium vertical-tab, group-layout, tab-style, omnibar, and
context-menu patches to its Chromium-hosted workspace UI, and adapts Helium's
settings/WebUI appearance patches and default-on rounded content frame to
Chromium 151, with Chromium 149 retained only as a compatibility fallback. The
rail
adaptations are modified because a cmux rail row represents a workspace rather
than a tab. The settings adaptation is modified to use cmux naming and to omit
Helium-only services and preferences. Detailed source paths, comparison
revisions, contributor attribution, and relevant upstream commits are listed
in ../../THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

Local Modifications:
Helium tab/group concepts are translated onto WindowModel workspaces and
workspace groups. Chromium's BSD-licensed collection animation manager is
adapted separately and is not represented as Helium-authored code. Settings
patches are rebased onto Chromium 151.0.7922.34, rename the Helium color token
to cmux, keep hidden pages routable, correct the imported SVG markup, and
register the rounded-frame preference. The custom terminal/browser surface
port preserves Helium's 3-DIP inset, attached-chrome edge treatment, 8-DIP
ordinary radius, native-window-concentric bottom radii, 1-DIP separator
outline, and fullscreen suppression. The 151 port was reviewed against Helium
main at Chromium 150.0.7871.128 because Helium does not yet publish a Chromium
151 patch base. The pane-local side-panel resize geometry was reviewed against
Helium revision `dee5600297344dd25b2dddb2ba343e19be7723f7` at Chromium
150.0.7871.181 (revision 8).
